window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-089-e51d752fc31fd335.json"]={sha256:"e51d752fc31fd335b481487da84026c2f9799c908ba77912f2737531fb493d65",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-de61aa8594aac5a8","url":"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/disaster-recovery-workloads-on-aws/disaster-recovery-options-in-the-cloud.html","title":"AWS disaster recovery of workloads","titleEn":"AWS disaster recovery of workloads","publisher":"AWS","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-089","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-089","related":[{"id":"security-v27-090","referenceUrls":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/antipatterns/noisy-neighbor/noisy-neighbor"],"title":"Azure Architecture：多租戶佇列公平與noisy neighbor隔離邊界","titleEn":"Azure Architecture: multitenant queue fairness and noisy-neighbor boundaries","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付dr-plans.json、activation-timeline.csv、cost-assumptions.csv與shared-dependencies.md；所有成本與時間保留合成標記。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver dr-plans.json, activation-timeline.csv, cost-assumptions.csv and shared-dependencies.md. Preserve synthetic labels on every time and cost quantity, together with the common service-verification criteria.","difference":"列出每租戶待處理數、每批次分配與未完成餘額；用合成工作檢查保留槽位政策，不能以總完成數掩蓋個別租戶飢餓。","differenceEn":"Record each tenant backlog, batch allocation and remaining work. Test reserved-slot policy on synthetic jobs without letting aggregate completion counts hide starvation of individual tenants.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["AWS文件區分pilot light與warm standby等策略；本課時間與點數成本是原創假設，非AWS價格、服務等級保證或現成採購建議。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 P方案依序擴容12分鐘、啟動8、同步5、驗證5，成本100點/月；W方案擴容4、同步3、驗證5，成本250點/月。 P需30分鐘、W需12，縮短18分鐘；每月增150點，每縮短一分鐘對應150/18=8.333333點/月。","Azure noisy-neighbor文件討論共享資源競爭與隔離；本課的固定預留政策是教學設計，資源公平與租戶資料授權仍為不同問題。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 每批10槽、各工作同時長；A有20、B有4、C有4。無保障先取A十件；預留政策分A4、B3、C3，未使用槽才可借出。 兩方案第一批都完成10件，但B+C完成率無保障0/8=0%，預留為6/8=75%；總吞吐相同不代表租戶體驗相同。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["AWS documentation distinguishes pilot light and warm standby strategies. Durations and cost points here are original assumptions, not AWS prices, service guarantees or a ready-made purchasing recommendation. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Plan P serially scales for twelve minutes, starts for eight, synchronizes for five and verifies for five, costing 100 points/month. Plan W scales for four, synchronizes for three and verifies for five, costing 250. P requires thirty minutes and W twelve, improving recovery by eighteen. The additional 150 monthly points correspond to 150/18=8.333333 points per month for each minute of modeled improvement.","Azure noisy-neighbor guidance discusses contention and isolation in shared resources. The fixed-reservation policy here is a teaching design; resource fairness remains distinct from tenant data-access authorization. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Each batch has ten slots and equal-duration jobs. Backlogs are A twenty, B four and C four. An unreserved A-first batch takes ten A jobs; the reserved policy allocates A four, B three and C three. Both policies finish ten jobs in the first batch. B+C completion is 0/8=0% without reservation and 6/8=75% with reservation; equal aggregate throughput does not imply equal tenant experience.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-099","referenceUrls":["https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/84/final"],"title":"NIST SP 800-84：訓練、測試與演練的證據型別矩陣","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-84: evidence types for training, tests and exercises","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付dr-plans.json、activation-timeline.csv、cost-assumptions.csv與shared-dependencies.md；所有成本與時間保留合成標記。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver dr-plans.json, activation-timeline.csv, cost-assumptions.csv and shared-dependencies.md. Preserve synthetic labels on every time and cost quantity, together with the common service-verification criteria.","difference":"將需求拆成知識、工具功能與協作決策三種，指定每種可接受證據；建立需求到證據的多對多映射與不適用標記。","differenceEn":"Classify requirements as knowledge, tool function or coordinated decision-making and specify acceptable evidence for each. Build a many-to-many requirement-to-evidence map with explicit not-applicable states.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["AWS文件區分pilot light與warm standby等策略；本課時間與點數成本是原創假設，非AWS價格、服務等級保證或現成採購建議。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 P方案依序擴容12分鐘、啟動8、同步5、驗證5，成本100點/月；W方案擴容4、同步3、驗證5，成本250點/月。 P需30分鐘、W需12，縮短18分鐘；每月增150點，每縮短一分鐘對應150/18=8.333333點/月。","NIST SP 800-84區分測試、訓練與演練並討論計畫；本課的12項矩陣是原創課程驗收，不是NIST合規認證分數。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 12項需求分知識4、工具4、協作4；已有知識證據4、工具測試2、協作演練1，另3張簽到表未滿足任何缺項。 有適切證據7/12=58.333333%；若把簽到三張當成缺項完成會誤報10/12=83.333333%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["AWS documentation distinguishes pilot light and warm standby strategies. Durations and cost points here are original assumptions, not AWS prices, service guarantees or a ready-made purchasing recommendation. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Plan P serially scales for twelve minutes, starts for eight, synchronizes for five and verifies for five, costing 100 points/month. Plan W scales for four, synchronizes for three and verifies for five, costing 250. P requires thirty minutes and W twelve, improving recovery by eighteen. The additional 150 monthly points correspond to 150/18=8.333333 points per month for each minute of modeled improvement.","NIST SP 800-84 distinguishes tests, training and exercises within a program. The twelve-item matrix here is original course acceptance criteria, not a NIST compliance certification score. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Twelve requirements comprise four knowledge, four tool-function and four coordination items. Available evidence satisfies four knowledge, two tool and one coordination requirement; three attendance sheets satisfy none of the missing items. Appropriate evidence covers 7/12=58.333333%. Treating three attendance sheets as completed missing requirements would falsely report 10/12=83.333333%.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-7b3e45cb45d047ea","url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/antipatterns/noisy-neighbor/noisy-neighbor","title":"Azure Architecture Center: noisy neighbor antipattern","titleEn":"Azure Architecture Center: noisy neighbor antipattern","publisher":"Microsoft","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-c666997afcd05e3f","url":"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/84/final","title":"NIST SP 800-84 test training and exercise programs","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-84 test training and exercise programs","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
